        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Arthur White, David Jason, John Sullivan\n- Roles: Ernie Trigg, John Sullivan \"Del Boy\" Trotter\n- Works: A Touch of Frost, Only Fools and Horses\n- Topics: family relationships, British television acting\n\nFacts:\n- Arthur White was born in 1933 and is an English stage and screen actor.\n- Arthur White is best known for his occasional role as police archivist Ernie Trigg in the crime drama A Touch of Frost.\n- Arthur White appeared in A Touch of Frost alongside his real-life younger brother David Jason.\n- David Jason is best known for portraying John Sullivan \"Del Boy\" Trotter in the British television series Only Fools and Horses.\n- Only Fools and Horses was written by John Sullivan.",
